"Only a detected DDC-capable display can enable automatic switching." = "只有偵測到支援 DDC 的螢幕才能啟用自動切換。";
"Native DDC display selector" = "原生 DDC 螢幕識別碼";
"If DDC fails, use the monitor OSD input menu." = "如果 DDC 失敗，請使用螢幕 OSD 輸入選單。";
