"One keyboard on M5 Pro (USB-C)" = "鍵盤接在 M5 Pro（USB-C）";
"External USB switch (bidirectional)" = "外接 USB switch（雙向）";
"Recommended for MA270U: M5 Pro uses USB-C and Intel uses HDMI." = "MA270U 建議接法：M5 Pro 使用 USB-C，Intel 使用 HDMI。";
"Both Macs must see the keyboard and mouse through a physical USB switch." = "兩台 Mac 都必須透過實體 USB switch 看見鍵盤與滑鼠。";
"This Intel Mac is HDMI-only in the current wiring, so it cannot originate keyboard/mouse input. Select the USB-switch mode after connecting the devices to both Macs." = "目前接線下這台 Intel Mac 只有 HDMI，不能發起鍵盤／滑鼠輸入。兩台 Mac 都接上裝置後，才能選擇 USB switch 模式。";
"Connect the keyboard and mouse to the M5 Pro (directly or through the MA270U USB hub). The Intel HDMI Mac can receive control only." = "請把鍵盤與滑鼠接到 M5 Pro（直接接或接 MA270U USB hub）。Intel HDMI Mac 只能接收控制。";
"MacKVM cannot detect a USB switch. Verify both Macs see the keyboard and mouse before requesting control." = "MacKVM 無法偵測 USB switch。請先確認兩台 Mac 都看見鍵盤與滑鼠，再請求控制。";
